{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1359,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c64d29a46f21320f4918c92e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，很帅气对吧──！\r\n训练员也一起穿嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0087bf210eae4e6676f9573cfa0066da4453ec865630aa842e5887fb5a839acc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea63bd5df83fe40310fb16b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乌拉拉～……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd3d647e1fb28109aa2002ecd4a0d84cd7621ca17653a54b22cb5a93b5bb0feb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9670da5021570aebfffae044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会拿下第一名的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f365003bb06f3c9205f4682f426ac0383681d278b3a9fc201dbf6e2e2e4892fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9c715893b56f25755b74751",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a849d614470f4ec2317d918",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，训练员！今天我没有迟到哦♪\r\n可能是我的脚变快了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "195402774e2ae96e7563849c222eac70d29d80ac7fec0097336d9ef8e90ec548",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff0085e15110f1d9ef4a24bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦？那边那个是小特吗？\r\n真稀奇──！\r\n明明是我比较早出宿舍的来着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58820dfc5924067b5934ab0c5f6788ff1b07ab6d0403e620a44b5aaf7e5ab5cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53f0c9bd44938857ee1d9b03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天一到中午就是\r\n胡萝卜面包的「抢夺战」！\r\n为了能吃到，我今天也要努力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d169956c2a10122f0e52ab065eccc15bded0a5f387ce9bae16fe54d3860e2eb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93d05c096fa24156ecd82d4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为中午吃很多的关系，\r\n肚子变圆滚滚了──\r\n呼啊～开始想睡觉了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fafdb9b8caba4ca7f8867315f0b113e38db66078bf84c33b94166aeb4f114d0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd551567735341982d1cf318",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦？已经到晚餐时间了？\r\n训练的时候都会很快就变晚上呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c91fbbbdf368e0a365fd63eedfd15505d01e4da1a1aa067a3a4fef8f040f62a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:732783762a4bf7ff0e4d2cb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我发现跟胡萝卜长得很像的星星哦！\r\n等一下告诉训练员是哪一颗♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "05afc9d8e175b2fe6f7bd1f1bb182bfa0ce53f68f3bd59288ecca7f00c0989e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94283bba0b1e7a072e8ba167",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想和大家一起去赏花啊──♪\r\n我要吃很多的胡萝卜跟团子哦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7149fd769777d32bd202712759f08d808819c743b58690737b3e7b978e7dc788",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3254b4777daf616ceae41844",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "西瓜跟胡萝卜都很好吃对吧？\r\n一起吃的话一定会变更好吃的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "453f7e0230c2e492a425acce1ac91aa872cae7c41f24fac2064efe42bed286ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74de01f31fd5f2c93e02a6a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "商店街的果蔬店\r\n每到秋天就会变得非常忙！\r\n该不该去帮忙一下呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e4cbd3f34bc24c2f799c0d99ec46eba1e9f9fe4e5283b82f7dc7382c3c1baae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b11f9c7d4398dc8f80d45ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感冒啊──我从来都没有得过哦！\r\n我的身体在冬天时也是暖呼呼的！\r\n充满活力充满活……阿嚏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d072236d47cbaa7d925c0e5c75ac60e7e14867a44884186c3eb4f2c77af73448",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a251b8a56497323caa6b580",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟你说喔！早上醒来，\r\n发现头发像门松一样乱七八糟！\r\n变得刺刺的好有趣喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b800fa9d612eec1bab736c3c37569a9a33a64347150e4ab4bbd07ee11b2a62c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28d9f89697ce8b281d5847f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圆滚滚～！……嘿嘿嘿！\r\n我在模仿早餐的荷包蛋喔！\r\n像是早上升起的太阳，很棒呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44dd8c0608e7b448868a41602f154e4a28d3f9f92135490c1b9d044e1278858a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f9e3af9c72c1c4e2dfdc181",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想到一个好主意！\r\n要是每天午餐都吃年菜的话，\r\n大家就能一直「围炉」了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1f9b67f8063308d5b8ed0afbc765d93dbe3bf0cccfee00860d84ea08197629b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86932b5deaae2b1232394859",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸欸，中午休息一下吧～我带了\r\n很多东西来喔！有玩双六的东西\r\n和风筝……啊，最推荐的是～歌牌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e53ba8e6a5c1c3956ebf2495c9203e09e7d66a93d693a2b2d7a3eb6170ef28f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04b9a69c8f15564c853b2f5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外面变暗了呢～啊！\r\n我可以去放风筝吗！？\r\n我要让风筝看看星星──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6f4be9e8aa98e3370c2173560519a736d615109512a4f3b78ee0ca2e376313b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:953eb0f92fa93400d6e8b696",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想睡觉的话我来帮忙！\r\n小福说过，念108次\r\n「咚～咚～」会有好运喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87897c6daa710e3a0cde34eda9d6b1e47db3d39e3085a596a607b772049e00ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aa802aa61d96263cab06931",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胡萝卜～春天也要吃胡萝卜～\r\n胡萝卜～嘿嘿嘿！\r\n唱歌打招呼大概就像这样吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "db29d0e7835ea1f35107530bb94612a96d3606bf36e8a3366b22fe6e38b5ec07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39cb0f239fc14538fedc8ebe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热──！现在放风筝的话，\r\n风筝会被晒伤呢！\r\n要帮它做好防晒才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a1b615194274a995104ea96af7e2cf036590b7a2171231fbc706ed4948e5b2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2fda1e5a83818347f95e7ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去捡栗子吧──！\r\n要找到很──多很大的，\r\n拿来做年菜的栗金团！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fe1074eebf6db52e7f14667ca3f7380c5ad3c34ca59b0eb46fbcce50590ea23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45a8b4957a12f433020b9e66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈说要送我适合\r\n搭配和服的围巾！\r\n会是怎样的围巾呢？真让人期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ed5bea9bba44239f761c06efdb56314d395e9b8f90319b0198413e94557e869",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b614799460055e693adb3dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐呢ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e41714cac7fcc8846b45c2d62f6bd64a6ccf13f0bbc39e7963da79b61ddb286",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:447c97b265debe8c3df32f34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐呢ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e41714cac7fcc8846b45c2d62f6bd64a6ccf13f0bbc39e7963da79b61ddb286",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:878b0ed43bf47c568f4edbc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和大家聊到了小时候的事情哦──\r\n我小时候就跟现在一样，\r\n一～直在跑步哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44f018e942fd5274c3aab542d19a3d32be8ff568d697778d34e6d002cc60f941",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a53ded24924f20a988eb6a56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小歌剧说只要笑就会变坚强哦！\r\n哈──哈哈哈！\r\n……有变吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1de56f450e48b25d64182b152200ef21eaff9a4e09f73f38fb73a70543b964d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23e305d2db8271da466d6519",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，小青她因为身体不舒服\r\n所以请假了哦！她说\r\n「想办法帮我说成不是逃课」这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "534dad60ae042c8f7a1fe6fa6d24a7823646c5e64439a10ca7210940015c28a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58f6129ef0e88f1029d5a13f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的考试分数不及格～但是因为\r\n「全部都有写答案很了不起哦」这样\r\n得到了满分认证哦！诶嘿嘿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "401f3b4ad5515fdba9fd2a398e903bb8490f908ad0c8e2afebdef83eb175296c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1b4055d8053395ed795637b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我要跟小特一起去\r\n胡萝卜甜点自助！\r\n我要大吃特吃哦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "595aa0bc6543134115e8708979de316295c65a3da04240ffbd33ff74107c7674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21e21636ccedfafd2b34a224",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是跟大家一样的衣服呢！\r\n一模一样，一模一样♪\r\n跟大家一模一样的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "93bfbf67c3a032ce3c4f84e1423641ce0700533b045abd67ddb7bfdfbc076f3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec8bf6ec2e0662fa9cfb6ae3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服很可爱吧──\r\n蹦蹦跳的时候蓬蓬的会飘起来哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "970e33f4176a603e25d561fbf2646be337f2fce09ec2175908786e23b75b3d4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0097293f960b3e18d9910a24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "决胜服很好活动所以我很喜欢──！\r\n还有啊，穿着的时候就会有种\r\n「我要加油──」的感觉哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da19ca55e5f3d472df0b70961a16e6468f7fc4ec132c92b48b84c4d512c28c88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a42a443a6375fd7965d428d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为乌拉拉是充满活力的人，\r\n所以也不怕跌倒哦！\r\n而且我还有创可贴呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d452870f37c178756ff8758af226d2f3201536e1ad221131ce870d8d7341c308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a56222fd27f663785cbb7e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道一流的广播体操吗？\r\n听说一直跟着做就会\r\n变得像小圣王一样哦！好神奇哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2b72f9b8106fd17812652ffdef680f6f68d75622b718bf7e76754fe17ea9d2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e63aa24da5df26bad9a75af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在胡萝卜田里睡午觉的话，\r\n说不定就会梦到很多胡萝卜呢……！\r\n呐呐，我们来试试看嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1347364eaada9d12da80fd30bdf87f55e9523093dd58a9fad1894701f54b28ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ebd04d38dac0982ab7da880",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果鬼怪出现了，\r\n我想跟它成为好朋友啊──\r\n我要跟它比赛赛跑哦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdf887faee82489d29dd81d47fbb1c3df6463180a52f04fb438b79ea3de7644a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebd6b69cea8ed66afa69edf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好多闪亮亮的新生哦──！\r\n好想跟大家变成朋友哦──♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd5541705ca9cd9839b6f725bf6502367f8fef7e5d22b668ef92698e316dfe6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:203975fc0c058bbb9d8cf897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热啊！\r\n大家一起去吃胡萝卜冰嘛──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ba4d61014895f346c1bf4539921195b8b6f5d93d6490313f1e069c07204248f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b065478f977bc906e9e944c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在红叶落地之前……抓住！\r\n这跟咬面包比赛一样好玩哦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67f7072dab75add6a5f18a6e2d247eba4d8d7526825fe77a58d6019513d2b7cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:432fca3e2a3c877b2a7884fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想跟大家一起打雪仗，\r\n又想跟大家窝在暖炉桌吃橘子……\r\n嗯──应该选哪个好啊──？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9640db5a19286d908b85b596ce86ed7d1327f483e7b330350e926098cdd041b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f16b2f80811b6f4135bcec3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要摆出小歌帮我想的\r\n最强和服造型姿势了！\r\n……像蔷薇一样，可爱绽放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e5ac1b84cbdc026ba6118891bed4fcef6ea76afda63614093f1c6d6b5ac35cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53c65bb1074d531acca7b954",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王的手是有魔法的手！\r\n因为她把头发转来转去！\r\n就能绑出这么漂亮的样子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "909fe6742be1d3660e4f35ec6a5a1c140fef7ec1c7bde454da3d4c4f49c17e04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8dc6c465654f8991feb3595",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～呼～呼～呼……好了！\r\n新年参拜喝甜酒的练习非常完美！\r\n下次不会再烫到舌头了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c43dda62764f036cc29c7c04179635746d747fcc1111f8372ca999e50df3b249",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d9a108c4007419bfc8fbd3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸欸！我们来种「柚子」吧！\r\n我也想在过年的时候\r\n发送给大家～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec4916c8b61207a86c32b1fbb62d1d67bbdf8dc8d736cb022cff75e8ddecfa03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8ec97536def2dcb13de8aac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红包袋让人很兴奋呢！\r\n会想说里面到底放了什么～\r\n希望会是胡萝卜脆片！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d34bac5f49e4eb1126a147bf21860226ab29ce11eb68a7d33026e7adaceff38a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ab4ddf2d5144e0ed29a17f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有用书法写下今天的目标！\r\n「要和学园的所有人打招呼」！\r\n好──我要加油～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5fb481665eccbeb1c555a751cb07e5dba21645330b5c485442de618a8e2404a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5a336f7d17d55a05ac162be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上国语课的时候有出现和小福\r\n一起学会的和歌！被老师夸说\r\n「真亏你知道」呢！嘿嘿嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e1c77f42d6a262165e5171409e385c49ca3a1959f7b623e82f48fb5f4faedbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c786b235aa1d8d28d0670eca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天要早起看日出！\r\n然后去找训练员！\r\n这样就能比平常多玩一点了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f74e0a6a66ba563ae38346f41205935d0cc69fa087925bfdeb5d16069a411ffe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b49f7dd9387365181f3614ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新春、新春──！\r\n嘿嘿嘿～！感觉只是说出口，\r\n就能让人跑得更快呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df2b4fdc915e6c53d57866f2c2831503875c119853656f14c7f21134d98a6eff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40c75bb168c4a17488592826",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这身和服，也能跳\r\n夜来舞呢！拿着鸣子响板，\r\n发出嚓嚓嚓的声音！喝啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "294590d5c70c186d1015451a5142382642770a533cee575ec33c2e52d2f3d5a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30ecb26fe502958f6da12528",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜～！吃太多地瓜了，\r\n肚子好胀……\r\n没有大一点的和服裤吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "828a62e32fba445346d7e630f6f3a3c16e93a303ac0f63de4ae23e17078918bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e2f7797bee5d57050ca79b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦咦──！？长距离接力赛\r\n不是拿狸猫跑，而是拿布条吗？\r\n得去告诉小涛才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2132077b7f95dbbcf694010d7e3a474aed32e2f707db1c5f39059b3bf0ec3d95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b08334e1e8bc0bda0b733836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "系和服的布条会让人整个挺直！\r\n变得立正站好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb55f11176cbc5955a838be00bc9a4c99daf422c688db231bbb2ba495ed76566",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:052d2036aa651c4cbb26d5de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这身和服转圈圈，\r\n就会看起来像陀螺一样喔！\r\n眼睛也会一起转来转去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2190a0af556e1d8b9ef4dddca8f1c64dabb4824275558fb13006098fdb8a1cca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df462894e6b3595ef82182e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一、二！一、二！\r\n热身操已经做好了哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d79bec5dd2f5959f35a31e69a23afa4f862f6b844d0480aa431c0f19ffbbac8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98eaff18d7a88c5848df3f6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "えいえいおー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "775ca50961ed54879efa1865c77b21cd1ec6d682b5e51e1c4328c4b272ff5435",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d32cea777b8c6e953b11d654",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练吗？好啊。\r\n刚好我的点心时间也结束了嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0904e467206c0378013384b72240395225d82792bd1fe08ac74d879c21e22c18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70998360906c766399b56930",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力做训练的话，会有奖励的吧？\r\n好──我要开始做了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "357dd96cc21855b4005b34df9a402ffbe54a782a215bb89ce6f1cac8c1f0c71f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2427684358413ad7fb0b7d6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要从什么开始做呢──？\r\n我想要做很有趣的训练啊──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a226509ae2493624d644fe7f20df38df0770e174ce93a0cc23c214a4b81a7ac9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f79cb6d8bfa64094b8985102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练的时候真的好开心哦──\r\n因为真的会感觉到自己变强了嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a72c3e294796ba9475feafa6aba31e2c821c6aba1d13d2621ff1a215b0568dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7522332aac5a7cd753988cd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我变得比原本还要能跑更久了哦！\r\n好开心哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "74d6df1d597a2574d1ee5c1e7e3145681ca6acd1d28f7a0a8f330fcbce6098ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7968b52336ab0baa4e3b2947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要不屈不挠就一定能获胜！\r\n我们继续多多训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0b05c3149e8c012f68409655e5c3d8d4de3b2dfd6bad7eade3b84f12307fae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fd483d8317d99aed4fdceeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要做什么样的训练呢──？\r\n好期待，好期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a616ca3b4d48480cd8520f9497c47531df87d5750dc0dd486c564fbaa4f6207",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:426f1cde7a9cc98cbe2ad7d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的我可是不太「一样」喔！\r\n不对，是二、三……嗯──！\r\n是不太很多样！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8727da15fd4c44a9bc7a3cbe6dbdb55955f5b87dee973a3371e94a8617d41836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eba503c7e7c833cb71833e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和米米玩了\r\n很──久的板羽球！\r\n不过还是很有精神喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a5b51b6b0c07e4dadb3032d89dddd7a262a3a42c604b553894efeb2f79895f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3341adb82789ee429ec9b40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸欸！不知道要做什么练习的话～\r\n用抽签来决定怎么样？\r\n一定会很有趣喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8d5cdadc2c913f136449bbc5d0cec5f3c0553149713925b4b28af30ac96d17c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:433fb1111d55d650504cdb0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参拜的时候啊，我有和神\r\n做了约定！说我会非──常\r\n拼命地跑！要祂好好看着我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2108ca353195666dea7cbe5832355ad54b55df7648af3bd95624e2b22b95a8c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4957370c5a29ee85bb2843cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了！我用训练员的脸\r\n做了笑福面～！\r\n等等一起玩喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a41fd26759f5bebf4b581e582e8684c69765a1f1cb5a4869966e1af6d8dcd2dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:334857f5fc6e2c40c8330c1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会在今年给训练员的贺年卡\r\n写上很──多「谢谢」喔！\r\n可能会多到明信片都写不下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cadea456777228ee567d485b5287c0a5e287abf3676aaf849f04248bf3ec0796",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:229e6fb57eb3e42513a403a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员明年也来\r\n高知过年吧！我会告诉你\r\n哪里可以看到最美的日出！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e926131bd09272413a128ad8cd9d49ea8254b1fb05f6af121a41041f0ade9d13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ea4280c7b6b5f20c5fe0390",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我是不会输给任何人的～♪\r\n对吧？训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5527157e051085368921701a4ffac482fd9a81f963ed0e9302e6754c52e7cc02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4dc3abc9ea1c9396367b8ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快称赞我、快称赞我～给我胡萝卜♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2d550de68fec552d15a8ba45c5ea08a53f0bd5fb72bc1e06696914feac1c281",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7029a4bb620333ace9b2dcea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明年和之后的每一年！\r\n都一起开心地乌～菈菈～♪吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13dbe0b19f98696d488dc8108ea790c3ad8be0f66b447607eacbbe214530fbe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05826cfbd573ca0a0d159ec7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像麻糬一样\r\n膨胀成长了喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ad38c91fe2c2b4cba117228b5d81d1f87b637b0be8c7f5e44c7974b43536e5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7dd012c31f0f7fce149449a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咻──！我是不是还长高了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3de83e7eaed9a5d11cd7801c1ea5e45fb063eea069fc6cdf20d01094faefcf70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2da6844a9215368399c6384",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定会变得更～好玩的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dcdc6b2616e575d6c8ec5a65e4bc5967d4dd8244fea410acb65b3d9434628d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef02ffcbc4d8737804115373",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春丽，会努力的──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39484dfd9f7c6a2163c7c16e492dd4a8f0def030b0a8a9811e93edb3d7c23762",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0182068bbea1f8c7b3370b69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力让你也能依靠我的──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97290dabe95cfc2d1b9c8cf23e27683d881f5a6085ced68a104e8990195222d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "95005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
